g and Support Services-2","width":1000,"height":667},{"src":"/assets/img/watari-youth-community-family-services/Watari-Counselling-and-Support-Services-0.webp","alt":"Watari Counselling and Support Services-0","width":1000,"height":667}],"about_blocks":[{"type":"h3","text":"About Center","html":"<strong>About</strong> Center","id":""},{"type":"p","text":"The Watari Youth Day Treatment Program is a 7 week voluntary alcohol and drug day treatment program for youth aged 13-24 in the Vancouver area. The goal of the program is to facilitate positive change for at risk children, youth and families through the development and delivery of innovative services. Participants can explore and develop skills in the following areas, within the context of substance abuse: * identity and self-awareness * relationships * communication and social skills * decision making * exploring and managing emotions * recreation and community support * creative expression * ongoing care","html":"The Watari Youth Day Treatment Program is a 7 week voluntary alcohol and drug day treatment program for youth aged 13-24 in the Vancouver area. The goal of the program is to facilitate positive change for at risk children, youth and families through the development and delivery of innovative services. Participants can explore and develop skills in the following areas, within the context of substance abuse: * identity and self-awareness * relationships * communication and social skills * decision making * exploring and managing emotions * recreation and community support * creative expression * ongoing care","links":[],"images":[]},{"type":"h4","text":"Therapies","html":"Therapies","id":""},{"type":"ul","ordered":false,"items":[{"text":"Holistic Therapy","html":"Holistic Therapy","links":[]},{"text":"Evidence-Based Practices","html":"Evidence-Based Practices","links":[]},{"text":"Yoga & Meditation","html":"Yoga &amp; Meditation","links":[]},{"text":"Individual Therapy & Counseling","html":"Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Family Therapy & Counseling","html":"Family Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Group Therapy & Counseling","html":"Group Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Nutritional Counseling","html":"Nutritional Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Art & Nature Therapy","html":"Art &amp; Nature Therapy","links":[]}]}],"specialty_groups":[{"heading":"Specialties","items":["Substance Abuse Treatmental","Assessment"],"text":""},{"heading":"Amenities","items":["Substance Abuse Treatmental","Assessment"],"text":""}],"info_items":[],"faq_heading":"","faqs":[],"hours":{"heading":"","rows":[]},"tags":{"heading":"","items":[]},"sponsor":{"label":"Sponsored Ad","title":"Start Your Journey Now","text":"Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada. Our list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered. For immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747","href":"tel:1-855-885-4747","image":{"src":"/assets/img/og/addiction-rehab-centers-canada-1.webp","alt":"addiction rehab centres","width":970,"height":920}}}}